;; What the model reads of each tool brainyard/analytics.clj defines: its description,
;; by tool id (brainyard.tool-words, byj-2e8.5). Read by the model, so a
;; resource (RFC-001).
{"session$analytics"
  "How this project's agent has been doing: success rate, iterations per turn, latency, cache hit rate, tool use and what it cost, over the recorded turns. Reach for it when asked whether something is working well or where time or money is going — not to find out WHAT happened, which is log$search and memory$history."}
